{"model": "gemma4:e4b", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Check only the host-pinned proposition below. Call verify_proposition with the supplied exact request arguments, without an output_dir. Do not substitute a related theorem. After the tool response, return only a JSON object with proposition_id, evidence_digest, verification_status and claim_holds copied from the checked evidence. Refutation means claim_holds=false; diagnostic/inconclusive evidence does not prove a universal claim. Do not repeat identical calls."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"proposition\":{\"assumptions\":[{\"kind\":\"diagonal\",\"symbol\":\"Omega\"},{\"kind\":\"zero_diagonal\",\"symbol\":\"W\"}],\"definitions\":{},\"domain\":\"matrix_identity_v1\",\"expression\":{\"left\":{\"column\":\"i\",\"matrix\":{\"left\":{\"name\":\"W\",\"op\":\"symbol\"},\"op\":\"matmul\",\"right\":{\"name\":\"Omega\",\"op\":\"symbol\"}},\"op\":\"entry\",\"row\":\"i\"},\"op\":\"equality\",\"right\":{\"body\":{\"left\":{\"column\":\"j\",\"matrix\":{\"name\":\"W\",\"op\":\"symbol\"},\"op\":\"entry\",\"row\":\"i\"},\"op\":\"scalar_multiply\",\"right\":{\"column\":\"j\",\"matrix\":{\"name\":\"Omega\",\"op\":\"symbol\"},\"op\":\"entry\",\"row\":\"j\"}},\"index\":\"j\",\"op\":\"sum\"}},\"original_text\":\"For every zero-diagonal square W and diagonal Omega, is (W Omega)[i,i] equal to sum_j W[i,j] Omega[j,j]?\",\"provenance\":{},\"quantifiers\":{\"indices\":[\"i\"],\"min_n\":1,\"scope\":\"universal\"},\"schema_version\":1,\"symbols\":{\"Omega\":\"matrix\",\"W\":\"matrix\"}},\"request_arguments\":{\"assumptions_digest\":\"50726b2d6dc981c7158870b41c1ab7a28aa838caaa390f503f42eeb9aaf21774\",\"expression_digest\":\"986d6714e75f91a95ac3b33fc55122dc6000724e029bc1f1dd8a15cd449d145d\",\"proposition_id\":\"1a919d3577d3da9a735896371b36477d81f8f0de31b22111ea0bea39ac776273\"}}"}], "temperature": 0, "max_tokens": 1500, "tools": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "verify_proposition", "description": "Check the exact operator-pinned proposition, never a model-selected substitute.\n\nSupply identities from the operator's reviewed request, not a theorem name.\nThe operator pins CENSUS_VERIFICATION_REQUEST before starting this process.\noutput_dir optionally writes a fresh existing-format evidence bundle.\nA refuted claim is a successful check; read verification_status/claim_holds.", "parameters": {"properties": {"proposition_id": {"title": "Proposition Id", "type": "string"}, "expression_digest": {"title": "Expression Digest", "type": "string"}, "assumptions_digest": {"title": "Assumptions Digest", "type": "string"}, "schema_version": {"default": 1, "title": "Schema Version", "type": "integer"}, "output_dir": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Output Dir"}}, "required": ["proposition_id", "expression_digest", "assumptions_digest"], "title": "verify_propositionArguments", "type": "object"}}}]}